<title>USA: Horace Mann adopts stock buyback program.</title>
<headline>Horace Mann adopts stock buyback program.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD, Ill. 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horace Mann Educators Corp said its board has adopted a repurchase program of up to $100 million of its common stock.</p>
<p>Shares will be purchased by Horace Mann from time to time through open market purchases and private purchases, as available.</p>
<p>The company said that if the entire $100 million program were utilized, the repurchased shares would represent about nine percent of Horace Mann's outstanding common stock.</p>
</text>
